        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku a ŋikaru a ŋatomonikanikaarei ebuni Ekapolon Tiro, ido eboŋokinete ŋituŋa keŋ amucuruso, emalaaketa ikes a napukasinei a daadaŋ a ŋuna eya nakwap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Italeikinio neni ke Ekapolon ŋiboro keŋ ŋulu egyelanari iŋes ka ŋisiliŋa ŋulu eryamununui iŋes anagyelanar, nyiŋadaaryo ŋiboro ŋulu eryamuni iŋes anagyelanar, kori nyituruworete ikes ŋulu kec, nai eryamunete ŋulu itopoloorito Ekapolon akimuj kec ŋina alalan ka ŋilowi kec aloboro a ŋulu a Tiro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
